**Cause:** the three Dart failures all compared the require round's *rendered text* to `"'mod"`. The value crossing the shell is the symbol `mod` on every host; only `dao.pretty`'s rendering of a `(quote sym)` form differs (`'mod` on JVM/cljs, `(quote mod)` on ClojureDart). A test-printing difference — production code untouched, as the brief directs.

